and whatever the outcome, I'll always love you. Look after the cats for me. The results from the recent football match indicated that Stephanie was still alive. Her parents were both relieved and distraught, while investigators believed that if they followed the kidnappers' demands, they might have a chance of bringing Stephanie home safely. Stephanie's manager Kevin Watts agreed to help, and investigators provided him with strategies to speak with the kidnapper to minimize threats to his own safety. As the kidnapper had already demonstrated that he was capable of traveling throughout the country, 1,000 detectives from the Midlands Police Forces, Scotland Yard and the Metropolitan Police

